<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-526] Infinite Recursion in DefaultTreeBuilder</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-526</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In some cases, building a random forest with a dataset that contains many numerical attributes, the DefaultTreeBuilder enters in an infinite recursion and throws a StackOverflowError.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12477537">MAHOUT-526</key>
            <summary>Infinite Recursion in DefaultTreeBuilder</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
