                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="12921711" author="adeneche" created="Sat, 16 Oct 2010 15:55:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Trying to build a forest using the attached dataset will throw an Exception. Thanks to Andrey Gusev who kindly shared this dataset.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12922607" author="adeneche" created="Tue, 19 Oct 2010 16:26:39 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I was able to find the smallest subset of the dataset, that makes the Builder throw a StackOverflowError. It&apos;s the following four instances:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;preformatted panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;preformattedContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;0.25, 0.0, 0.0, 5.143998668220409E-4, 0.019847102289905324, 3.5216524641879855E-4, 0.0, 0.6225857142857143, 4
0.25, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0010504411519893459, 0.005462138323171171, 0.0026130744829756746, 0.0, 0.4964857142857143, 3
0.25, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0010504411519893459, 0.005462138323171171, 0.0026130744829756746, 0.0, 0.4964857142857143, 4
0.25, 0.0, 0.0, 5.143998668220409E-4, 0.019847102289905324, 3.5216524641879855E-4, 0.0, 0.6225857142857143, 3&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Now I will be able to debug and see what&apos;s causing this and how to prevent it.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12922707" author="adeneche" created="Tue, 19 Oct 2010 20:31:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This patch adds both a unit test and a fix to the StackOverflowError problem&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12922711" author="adeneche" created="Tue, 19 Oct 2010 20:42:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I will need to test this patch on previous datasets and see if the results are the same. Then I should be able to commit it as soon as the &quot;code freeze&quot; ends&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12927037" author="adeneche" created="Mon, 1 Nov 2010 16:45:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;committed the patch&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="12927221" author="hudson" created="Mon, 1 Nov 2010 23:28:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Integrated in Mahout-Quality #442 (See &lt;a href=&quot;https://hudson.apache.org/hudson/job/Mahout-Quality/442/&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://hudson.apache.org/hudson/job/Mahout-Quality/442/&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
</comment>
